	* config/microblaze/microblaze.md (adddi3): Accept any CONST_INT
	as operand 2, and output it with microblaze_output_adddi3_imm.
	* config/microblaze/microblaze.cc (microblaze_split_dword_const):
	New function.
	(microblaze_output_adddi3_imm): New function.
	(microblaze_adddi3_imm_length): New function.
	* config/microblaze/microblaze-protos.h
	(microblaze_output_adddi3_imm, microblaze_adddi3_imm_length):
	Declare.

gcc/testsuite/ChangeLog:

