 gcc/config/microblaze/microblaze.cc           | 60 +++++++++++++++++++
 gcc/config/microblaze/microblaze.md           | 25 +++++---
 .../gcc.target/microblaze/isa/adddi3-imm.c    | 22 +++++++
 .../microblaze/others/adddi3-imm-run.c        | 49 +++++++++++++++
